# Vault history source study

Selected upstream source is KeePass 2.61.1, Copyright (C) Dominik Reichl and contributors, GPL-2.0-or-later. The exact released license is preserved as [source/Docs/License.txt.snapshot](stage/source/Docs/License.txt.snapshot); the separate icons license is preserved as [source/Ext/Icons_Nuvola/License.txt.snapshot](stage/source/Ext/Icons_Nuvola/License.txt.snapshot). Source-assisted candidate history code retains GPL-2.0-or-later attribution; this notice does not determine a broader repository distribution license. No logo/icon use is added.

The [selected source census](stage/source-census.final.json.snapshot), [source acquisition provenance](stage/source-acquisition.final.json.snapshot), [contracts](stage/contract-map.json.snapshot) and [dirty editor guard spans](stage/draft-contract-map.json.snapshot) bind the complete original carrier census and selected source bytes. Four identical ZIP carrier copies are preserved locally and excluded from public inert snapshots; the full executable is authenticated locally by tests and is not embedded. The [preservation manifest](preservation-manifest.json) records every historical artifact and its actual local/public disposition.
